{"overview":"Of the films that Psilander made at Nordisk during the first two years it is the film Dødsspring til Hest fra Cirkuskuplen (The Great Circus Catastrophe), that is worth noting. Maybe not so much for Psilander's acting, but for the sensational, action-packed storylines that he was in. This film shows the other side of Psilander's fame: his daring. He was an excellent rider and looked fantastic in long riding boots and elegant riding jackets and this skill was exploited in his films.","cast":[{"n":"Valdemar Psilander","c":"Grev Willy von Rosenörn","p":"/mNXQWsE62xaYyvVtHsNuVP8L6pH.jpg","q":"Q722230"},{"n":"Ellen Ræder","c":"Skolerytterske Mlle Doré","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Jenny Roelsgaard","c":"Danserinden Miss Evelyn","p":null,"q":"Q35984031"},{"n":"Aage Hertel","c":"Cirkusdirektør Winge","p":"/x04ElBzmql7rAFzMpP2zJi7bYcT.jpg","q":"Q12300195"},{"n":"Frederik Jacobsen","c":"Gamle John - tjener hos greven","p":"/qh07avCB5lZXqdpUwYAuZzKOGv5.jpg","q":"Q5499292"},{"n":"Frederik Christensen","c":"Sagfører","p":"/w8sp1HLa2uYc26tnuIOQlNOiR9q.jpg","q":"Q12312559"},{"n":"Axel Mattson","c":"Cirkusrytter","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Lauritz Olsen","c":"Værtshusgæst","p":"/iqOLPp2O8tRm63rn9ljM0UC8eUC.jpg","q":"Q6026072"},{"n":"Alma Hinding","c":"","p":"/b7Zq9FKL9rQoG8hba0q5yZRHw7z.jpg","q":"Q12301124"},{"n":"Valda Valkyrien","c":"","p":"/6VkhCO1Vd6frohe3e8UYm3agT1j.jpg","q":"Q4993986"}],"country":["Denmark"],"qid":"Q16904088","rel":{"DK":{"d":"1912-08-26"}},"stills":["silent-ddsspring-til-hest-fra-cirkuskuplen_1.webp","silent-ddsspring-til-hest-fra-cirkuskuplen_2.webp","silent-ddsspring-til-hest-fra-cirkuskuplen_3.webp","silent-ddsspring-til-hest-fra-cirkuskuplen_4.webp"]}